    // the exponent is a. But we need E[p^X] = sum_a p^a * P(X=a).

    // Let f(t, a) = E[p^X_t | X_0 = a] where X_t is the exponent after t steps.
    // f(0, a) = p^a
    // f(t+1, a) = (1/(a+1)) * sum_{j=0}^{a} f(t, j)

